Package: cigamingos-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: misc
Priority: important
Homepage: @REPO_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS archive signing key and apt source
 Installs the public key that signs the CiGaming OS package repository
 (@REPO_URL@) and enables that repository, so `apt upgrade` delivers
 CiGaming OS updates alongside Debian's.
